@startuml
[*] --> Initial State
Initial State -> Quick Review Menu : Click Quick Review Button
Quick Review Menu -> Reviewing Specific Version : Select Version
Quick Review Menu -> Comparing Versions : Select Multiple Versions
Reviewing Specific Version -> Quick Review Menu : Click Back
Comparing Versions -> Quick Review Menu : Click Back
Comparing Versions -> Viewing Differences : Click Compare
Viewing Differences -> Comparing Versions : Click Back
Quick Review Menu --> Final State : Exit Feature
Reviewing Specific Version --> Final State : Exit Feature
Comparing Versions --> Final State : Exit Feature
Viewing Differences --> Final State : Exit Feature
@enduml
